{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17783","headline":"春日奉献圣寿无疆词十首 十 · 杨巨源","name":"春日奉献圣寿无疆词十首 十","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"化洽生成遂，功宣动植知。\n瑞凝三秀草，春入万年枝。\n凤掖嘉言进，鸳行喜气随。\n仗临丹地近，衣对碧山垂。\n渥泽方柔远，聪明本听卑。\n愿同东观士，长对汉威仪。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨巨源","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17783.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17783","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}